{"time": 1768288596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084788020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“对了，以后叫我玛莲妮娅”"}
{"time": 1768288680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124706426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是，玛莲妮娅大人”叫的倒是顺口，随后往后退了点"}
{"time": 1768288811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579113884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“如果没事，平时可以来这里聊天，那要是有事除开星期天的发放苹果之外是非硬性要求的”"}
{"time": 1768288846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518245012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "她点了点头，叮嘱了下其他人“星期天的时候记得来领你们的衣服”，随后准备又回广场里面去了"}
{"time": 1768288896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1950592780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明白。”随后，大概，在广场上逗留一阵，简单听听成员们聊些什么？"}
