{"time": 1770212153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153843243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（你当人家是在关口堵着呢）"}
{"time": 1770212171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519666479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之就是那个方向继续走呗）"}
{"time": 1770212192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601480269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也没有把“仓库”和“试验田”写在脸上的地方吧）"}
{"time": 1770212263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283738609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们将这场战斗抛之脑后，虽然想不通他们在打不打的时候往后边的街道走，有没有差别。不过很快就来到了圈着广场的街道，继续往前走就是广场对面的生活住房，与这里的任何一片区域没什么不同"}
{"time": 1770212486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363891931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“像个迷宫一样”*有些头疼“不过按照之前的经验……该不会在哪处的地下？”"}
{"time": 1770212751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079590100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "事已至此，好像不如回广场附近看看有没有地道"}
{"time": 1770212824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573312268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "当你回广场的时候，发现战斗已经结束了，葛瑞克兵败如山倒，广场中央开了朵黑色的花，周围的人死了死疯了疯，只剩下那么几个包含格瑞克的人"}
{"time": 1770212913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422166953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "然后葛瑞克跑了，身上的外骨骼只剩下那么几个架子掉在原地上"}
{"time": 1770212922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162485382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=5D6D1BDBFC7512F225EF8752ECD44F96.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTAju8lSMlplRS1GckRSzn3gDoHZhikzAUg_woos4Kbg_2_kgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQawahXK6DypdnG_qjsD4qOXoCfrOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMC2gpZH_I1-B8lwHWEc1tKAp2Dx8bIGd_NXXVkYHzINyRdQj7zusU9PSJFMckBsQHQ,file_size=91684]"}
