{"time": 1770216245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859227826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我.......已经没事了”女武神站起身来“尽管毫无素质可言，他们是我来到这里之后招到的还算不错的手下”"}
{"time": 1770216407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34514511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我很遗憾”随后，像是有些埋怨般直言“……您料到了这样的结果吗？为什么……不让他们离开呢？”"}
{"time": 1770216560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382407344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我没有........我也试过说服他们离开”女武神用着古典铠甲的手撑住了额头，你注意到有着细微的黑色纹路爬满了这个古典铠甲表面"}
{"time": 1770216680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089753959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是她的绝望和黑之根共鸣了”夜鸦忽然开口说"}
{"time": 1770216714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957544409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“你不清楚，但送你来的人应该清楚的”"}
{"time": 1770216744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798372105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "女武神没有反驳，只是低着头"}
{"time": 1770216746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230252406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo-Pi1oovAkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQXcKMLn3An3csqtYKZIQ6anoCLNyCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMNObSQ5byoeTgbKJ5jFtIIVamqC21ZgQmIIvgQN-tig3UAuGyxh9QWi3no8_iF69uA,file_size=39951]"}
