{"time": 1770348920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492888408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（语文理解，反复强调的意思是加压.jpg）"}
{"time": 1770348935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897462040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森没什么想法，看队友想不想吧，不过这种事是可以和女仆说的吗？"}
{"time": 1770348946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419767326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”有些犯难，但是姑且还是多问几句“几位皇储都是什么样的人？”"}
{"time": 1770348978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209565846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那你也知道，本身我们也该置身事外才是。\"收回视线，\"至少现在，我不会给你肯定的答案。\""}
{"time": 1770349043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430471450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过仙仙也不是那么严肃的人啦。\"扑哧笑了笑，\"这样吧～如果有机会，能够确认这就是三殿下的意思的话，那这份委托也不是不可以接哦～\""}
