{"time": 1770387481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823059868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，我想是这样。对了，雷内虽然在魔法上给我提供了不少帮助，不过明天晚上你们就带着他一起过去吧，至少我作为宫廷法师即便不亲自去，还要派代表过去的”"}
{"time": 1770387558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414507479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“如果这地方有什么需要我们的，我想除了做个马前卒，也没什么特殊的了。”摇摇头，“阁下可以指点一二我的法术吗？”"}
{"time": 1770387575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182012493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#警觉"}
{"time": 1770387582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510401611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#脸色微白"}
{"time": 1770387649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226401548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1812588255]“这就不是我能告诉你们的事情了，不过仔细一想，或许确实之后会添乱子吧，你们还是要做好防备比较好”"}
{"time": 1770387674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894196144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【这是默认了】"}
{"time": 1770387676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446477677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1414507479]“我没有兴趣哦，其实我不太喜欢战斗”"}
{"time": 1770387692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709270121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我、我吗？”"}
{"time": 1770387730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124424943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（什么你，是雷内）"}
{"time": 1770387748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543501996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1226401548]（我能防备什么（）"}
{"time": 1770387761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400174908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好吧，嗯...我只是请求一下阁下的指点啦。”挥挥手，“因为我只有这种程度的斤两了。”"}
{"time": 1770387775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620634027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（哦，这个啊，感觉我们也是被路边踢死的存在）"}
{"time": 1770387813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996284938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“当然了，如果因为什么岔子死了可就不好”"}
{"time": 1770387866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552719650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“感觉我们在这个世界也不过是被高端战力随便踢死得得存在。”"}
{"time": 1770387899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598170071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“躲着点咯”"}
{"time": 1770387975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40003571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不过我想问的是，阁下作为宫廷法师，对于王储的一事的态度又是如何？”"}
{"time": 1770388016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088274033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（这个不是已经问过了）"}
{"time": 1770388033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952216549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“您对于胜者是无条件支持？”"}
{"time": 1770388056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391135385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（我组织一下）"}
{"time": 1770388060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648958309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“或许我会考虑辞职也不一定”"}
{"time": 1770388077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291741803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“啊.....辞职吗”"}
{"time": 1770388087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37800826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不过重点不在这些，后来或许你们会知道吧”"}
{"time": 1770388121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384858087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#只是点头"}
{"time": 1770388227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291080014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那您如何看待这个王国？”"}
{"time": 1770388268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119408000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“谁又可能握着最多的筹码？”"}
{"time": 1770388290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951969731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这个王国吗？那还真是复杂，不过我应该爱着它”"}
{"time": 1770388352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876740686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=951969731]#点头"}
{"time": 1770388395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449404117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“至于有关其他王子，恕我直言我了解的并不清楚，也不清楚他们想要依靠武力到什么程度”"}
{"time": 1770388423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558897363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“了解了。”"}
{"time": 1770388430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "414432677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（还有什么问题吗）"}
{"time": 1770388457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352826763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我没有了）"}
{"time": 1770388467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572667919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过说句题外话”"}
{"time": 1770388481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "520902831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“女士您是怎么看待命运的”"}
{"time": 1770388488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977986533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“命运真的存在吗”"}
{"time": 1770388513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820539935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我从没考虑过，我想也不重要吧。”"}
{"time": 1770388536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302486611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "反倒是旁边的雷内欲言又止被伸手示意可以说话之后说"}
{"time": 1770388558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218111872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是个有意思的事情”"}
{"time": 1770388620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131194031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（训的狗吗，允许说话才能说）"}
{"time": 1770388632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975419564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（人家有礼貌）"}
