{"time": 1770474456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857553320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们返回房间的时候路过最开始你们召唤来到的庭院时发现那里降下了帘子还点着光亮，模糊之间看到了里面有人在"}
{"time": 1770474496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304021826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1770474507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135583336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#揉了揉眼"}
{"time": 1770474585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611838914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特手手上拿着一瓶酒水和两个杯子，看着那边，想了想正好打算找个花园喝酒，就去看看吧"}
{"time": 1770474743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307647210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（酒水我就当是你自备的了）"}
{"time": 1770474816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895461213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "帕特森往亭子那边靠近并掀开发现是两个人在里面，一个看起来是黑发的中年男子，另一个看起来是白发红瞳的青年"}
{"time": 1770474868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018729366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（啧，居然是两个男的）"}
{"time": 1770474878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050329168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哦？少年，我有所耳闻，你们是被召唤来的异世界人？”中年男子看向帕特森打个招呼，示意可以到里边一起坐"}
{"time": 1770474910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220482409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "青年只是沉默着，似乎是在想点什么"}
{"time": 1770474915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217672443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“晚上好，先生们”#帕特森点点头，既然邀请了那么就坐过去"}
{"time": 1770474953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952587469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#帕特森把红酒开下来醒酒“要尝尝看吗，二位”"}
{"time": 1770475043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597460233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我叫帕特森，不知二位名字”"}
{"time": 1770475069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974754565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这是来自异世界的吗，请来吧。”男子微笑着点了点头，青年也稍微微点了点头默认"}
{"time": 1770475111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539025436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#不是很放心，坐在外面等吧"}
{"time": 1770475168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431195974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“时臣，直接这么称呼我就好。”中年男子，也就是时臣先开口说道"}
{"time": 1770475204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736311017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“图斯柯”青年也随后寡淡的回应"}
{"time": 1770475236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118117523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "倒也不急着去图书馆，跟在猫猫坐在外面。"}
{"time": 1770475261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887073580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我只听说我们的宫廷法师又在研究新魔法了，没想到真的召唤出了异世界人，感觉皇宫怎么样”时臣接着说道"}
{"time": 1770475355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507281531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“大臣阁下和第八王子殿下，久仰大名，希望没有打扰到你们”#帕特森听到他的询问思索了一两秒“还算待的习惯吧，或许是因为我第一次来到皇宫，也是在房间里面待了段时间”"}
{"time": 1770475378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617275785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#不过帕特森看了一眼第八王子，不是被虏走了吗"}
{"time": 1770475411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272856064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "图斯科的视线不由间的飘向了你的红酒上，不过依旧沉默着"}
{"time": 1770475458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376329498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“没有没有，我也正好奇，你们那些异世界是什么样子的？”时臣依旧接着话茬"}
{"time": 1770475477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253398332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(想喝血了这是)"}
{"time": 1770475595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58644499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们的那个世界吗”#帕特森闭上眼睛回想“和这个世界相差很大的，那边除了魔法也有科技，不需要魔力就可以日行千里的车子，靠着燃料就可以飞出星球，靠着烧开水来发电，有着电视什么的”#给他们解释一下电视，电话是什么"}
{"time": 1770475707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81670783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1272856064]“异世界的酒水，要试试看吗”"}
{"time": 1770475806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594871390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“那可真是奇怪的世界，异世界，真是多种多样”时辰点了点头“对了，我听说你们已经没法回去，今后有什么规划吗”"}
{"time": 1770475839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391433762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=81670783]“嗯”图斯柯点了点头，挪开了视线，随后干脆的闭上了眼"}
{"time": 1770475916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513013452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“暂时还没有，这一切发生的蛮仓促的，一时还没有反应过来”#帕特森倒是不觉得八王子有什么，毕竟自己也见过不少东西“不过大臣对我们有什么安排吗，说到底也算是入乡随俗”"}
{"time": 1770476038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489333654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯.......图斯柯正好也和你一般无二，之后做他的随从怎么样，也好打点他的后路”"}
{"time": 1770476122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470946914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（和我一般无二？啥意思）"}
{"time": 1770476149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025047340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“emmm，那么我的同伴呢”"}
{"time": 1770476152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71687639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(他也是异世界来的)"}
{"time": 1770476165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221358833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（他也还没想明白往后干什么）"}
{"time": 1770476172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648327347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1770476175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997481726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哈哈，如果他们愿意，自然也是可以”"}
{"time": 1770476188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786628453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#抖耳朵"}
{"time": 1770476193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182904942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#我听得到他们对话吧"}
{"time": 1770476209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040824598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过有个问题。。。图斯柯殿下不是第八王子吗。。。怎么和我们一样”"}
{"time": 1770476237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772618356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "听不到"}
{"time": 1770476251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644870059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "帘子没拉开就听不到"}
{"time": 1770476292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565434366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "那算了"}
{"time": 1770476339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601792008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是有着不少事情，近些天来他才回到皇宫，或许之后也不会久待了”"}
{"time": 1770476464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197185185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“。。。请容我考虑一下，这个事情要是允许我和同伴说的话，我也就和他们商量一下”"}
{"time": 1770476479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32350456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过殿下他现在没有什么想法吗？”"}
{"time": 1770476485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997930942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“一点也没有吗”"}
{"time": 1770476590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010749530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "图斯科撇了你一眼，但没说什么，只是低下了头，手肿着腿手掌撑着下巴，大抵是就这样子默认了"}
{"time": 1770476673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409409062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=457E91920140043BD988972357526825.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRrr8AwhK0jDzpZyN4sfLUcxmyRPRiylwwg_woo2dChydPHkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQS4G_uYdwWO3pRM7zPChxenoC_J-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMEMSe3DyDu5OKr7X3piJhkTI9H9CMKeafbqA0LQMsGk7omGUBkPszwjOTPtV8ewESg,file_size=199602]"}
{"time": 1770476732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363775970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woosufI5dPHkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQjAilM1jL1K2ZrX9CqTOz4noC4VaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMEMSe3DyDu5OKr7X3piJhkTI9H9CMKeafbqA0LQMsGk7omGUBkPszwjOTPtV8ewESg,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1770476790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061912155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“emmm，没事，不知道殿下能不能给我讲讲你的故事呢，或许我可以帮你找到想要做的事情”"}
{"time": 1770476942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965931726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#在外面发呆看天空"}
{"time": 1770476950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184976521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我以前不住在皇宫，住在天岩家，最近父皇病逝，所以被叫过来了”图斯科开口回应道"}
{"time": 1770477012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188289159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“天岩家？那是哪里”"}
{"time": 1770477026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481969890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（不过有个问题，他不是原本在皇宫被掳走了吗）"}
{"time": 1770477036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290498046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（怎么没有住在皇宫）"}
{"time": 1770477042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333139441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "感觉也没必要继续等？在猫猫面前挥挥手心展示自己的手镯，对安娜开口，“安娜？我们走吧~”"}
{"time": 1770477076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287760031", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“只是个事商的贵族，照顾了我许多”"}
{"time": 1770477151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542928533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“只是个事商的家族，照顾了我许多”"}
{"time": 1770477183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99521574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“诶？嗯”安娜点了点头，拉住仙仙的手准备回去了"}
{"time": 1770477288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438403483", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“找找图书馆在哪？拜读一下这里的魔法，嗯哼？”反正已经牵住了手，干脆靠近一些，脑袋搭在安娜的手臂上，低低地打个哈欠。"}
{"time": 1770477300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186630929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过我听到了一些关于殿下的传闻，比如被血族拐跑了之类的，这是真的吗”"}
{"time": 1770477322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401140919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#点了点头"}
{"time": 1770477483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367603821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“图斯科不就是在这里吗，不过传闻嘛.........”时臣在旁边开口说了句，随后便闭嘴了"}
{"time": 1770477504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713148748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（刚刚逛了一圈宫廷法式的图书馆又出来找图书馆说是）"}
{"time": 1770477526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185687886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（好的，那我改一下喵）"}
