{"time": 1770559168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478892024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "那么这次留下来学习的人，直接把贵族礼仪和舞蹈这两个学识提升到40，如果灵感加值有到10的话就50"}
{"time": 1770559191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558607654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（什么，还有速成班）"}
{"time": 1770559230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685276662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（另一边）"}
{"time": 1770559231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428033086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么，还有速成班）"}
{"time": 1770559261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098773832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "仙仙还有安娜兜兜转转终于出了王宫，以及城堡的围墙，看起来卫兵都没有打算阻拦的意思"}
{"time": 1770559380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320241001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "外面的城市看起来格外繁华，无数的石房与木房拼凑着延伸向远方"}
{"time": 1770559546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384480692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "早上的时间街道已经开始稀稀疏疏的热闹起来，甚至还有早餐在卖"}
{"time": 1770559725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804344621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯～这里的风格和我那里很像嘛。\"手掌平放在额头，眺望远方，\"虽然刚刚吃过了，要不要再吃一点?\"眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1770559785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075707788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“我们没有带钱出来吧，还是？”安娜跟在身后看着周围的样子，也被周围的气氛渲染的开心了许多"}
{"time": 1770560018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697027267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"首饰就够用了啦。\"随手摘下一个耳环，\"在这种地方，应该够了?唔，虽然有假黄金，不过宝石可不会造假。\""}
{"time": 1770560089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698001040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"到处逛逛啦，上次有这样的机会，还是我没死之前好久。\"拍拍脸，\"咦，好像也不对，算了。待在那种狭窄的宫闱里人会生锈的。\""}
{"time": 1770560121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37843008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=478892024][CQ:at,qq=961142868] （我也留下来把）"}
{"time": 1770560207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628612235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“不清楚，那先去哪里？”"}
{"time": 1770560303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239854498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“换点现金，嗯...”思索，“然后逛逛街，看看有没有什么有趣的人或者事情吧~反正，那些烦人的工作，明天才会开始嘛。”"}
{"time": 1770560359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895602596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你发现所谓的假币流传，其实是货币本身被伪造了，现在的人身上都是带着一背包的硬币买东西，看起来蛮重的"}
{"time": 1770560373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437133630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "某种程度上所有人的财富被均分了"}
{"time": 1770560399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184039825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而你"}
{"time": 1770560405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944916787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "现在获得了两麻袋的硬币"}
{"time": 1770560472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571673257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "这两麻袋扛着嫌累，拖着嫌麻烦"}
{"time": 1770560476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446657952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woo4MHH4YvKkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQgZYz6-_SjJWWrGKt8_N9DHoCeq-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMO-4JYfF8RaLbOEj9P0qyGAQB2L7FwgH1mFDdeinzXShger53JTy7gh3c2Uf7Xb2IQ,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1770560493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950165850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1770560589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205270688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "背着当然不现实，勉勉强强拖着吧，反正也够引入注目了，顺着街道往前，遇见各式小吃就买一点，顺便问问去冒险者协会的路。"}
{"time": 1770561362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399938368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(得先解决货币的问题)"}
{"time": 1770561394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107351548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=11DF10A2E401E8E2818ECF27E814E059.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQY-5LunQBjX6Hymf7ah1q6rAoRNRiPuAIg_woojYrAl4_KkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQMzVHrLh38z3uLXcs2XWwTHoCreKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMO-4JYfF8RaLbOEj9P0qyGAQB2L7FwgH1mFDdeinzXShger53JTy7gh3c2Uf7Xb2IQ,file_size=39951]"}
{"time": 1770561442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322588706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你们一路走一路吃，麻袋减少重量的速度意外的居然还挺快，你也看的出来穷的人心情还算好，富的人心情不太好"}
{"time": 1770561491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792584969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "不过，显然对于每个人来说，最近负重运动都有点多了"}
{"time": 1770561541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006685803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而至于路边的美食，事实上也远不及你们所吃过的现代美食，无论是调料或是别的都味道比较为乏味或者野味过重"}
{"time": 1770561615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599632339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "最后抵达冒险者协会的时候，你看到了那个还算得上比较大的石房，里边还格外的宽阔"}
{"time": 1770561642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944909095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，反正现阶段自己只算是过客，在这里逛街也只是想找回曾经在故土上的那种感觉，至少，心情不错。接下来就是去看看眼前的冒险家协会了，“我当初也是冒险者哦？”笑着对安娜开口，“从家里偷溜出来当冒险家，嗯...虽然一次正经的冒险都没完成啦。”"}
{"time": 1770561695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34751918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "然而进去的时候发现里面有点冷清，几乎没有人在了，只有那么两三前台服务员在后面，一旁的等候区更是只有一个人在沙发上睡大觉"}
{"time": 1770561777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220637747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱了皱眉，走到前台询问，“您好？这里是冒险者协会的招待处吗？”"}
{"time": 1770561887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092660645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“是的，请问是需要办理什么服务呢？”"}
{"time": 1770561984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241263792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯..我想申请成为冒险者。”"}
{"time": 1770562107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309082421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“啊，那还真是欢迎。现在申请成为冒险者的话需要.......”前台特意看了下自己的文件“10金，唉，真是的，铜币还有银币现在完全没用了”"}
{"time": 1770562183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369544483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "顺便你有注意到你获得的都是金币"}
{"time": 1770562314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682347784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（穷人：这辈子没背过这么多金币）"}
{"time": 1770562339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910140709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哦，只需要交钱就可以了？”有些疑惑，递过金币"}
{"time": 1770562374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512305660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“哦，还要填表进行登记”"}
{"time": 1770562394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142370957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "前台接过金币之后递出张表格来“两位都要吗？”"}
{"time": 1770562418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579284807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“两位的话就是20金币了”"}
{"time": 1770562430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157056825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1682347784]（不喜欢吗？怎么不多背背）"}
{"time": 1770562598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194093502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"点头，\"这里怎么没什么人?\"把表递一张给安娜"}
{"time": 1770562654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448277018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“毕竟赚的钱过几天又要降一倍价格，大家也没有什么动力了，总归还是拼命的活，这样下去也会没有必要吧”"}
{"time": 1770562679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852966486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "你看到表格上面基本上都是姓名，年龄，能力，故乡，种族之类的基本信息"}
{"time": 1770562703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937109416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "而初始的表格上面默认写了个等级，上面是【铁】"}
{"time": 1770562753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346172903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这样下去还愿意工作的人会越来越少吧”"}
{"time": 1770562861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736358889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"附和地点点头，随意地写下自己的个人信息，当然种族填的红魔，\"喏，看看有没有什么问题。\""}
{"time": 1770562892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338279688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（你是不是没成年来着）"}
{"time": 1770562909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314192466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯？未成年不可以成为冒险者”"}
{"time": 1770563039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552047059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（难蚌）"}
{"time": 1770563157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485815385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...我看上去像是没成年吗？\"皱眉，指着自己，\"刚刚随便填的，填错了。\""}
{"time": 1770563312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36628591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我懂了，黄金巫师是鱿鱼，50万马可买面包）"}
{"time": 1770563322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680506368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（要不然直接德意志吧）"}
{"time": 1770563339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776808958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我有海王和魅惑，煽动普通人还是可以的）"}
{"time": 1770563341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089839010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:face,id=277,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;]"}
{"time": 1770563361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741245164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "对面皱眉看了下“最近再怎么也不会缺钱吧，虽然可能买不了魔法道具”"}
{"time": 1770563699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532067505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"都说我不是未成年了。\"气鼓鼓地看着，\"好了，到底给不给通过?\""}
{"time": 1770563861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237132605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "她叹了一口气"}
{"time": 1770563890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243483769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“这些魔物激增很多，而且愿意清理的冒险者很少，就算出任务你也要量力而行”"}
{"time": 1770563907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675476087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "说起来能力填了吗？"}
{"time": 1770564424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732079115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（填了魔法使三个大字可能）"}
{"time": 1770564501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516613643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“知道了，反正天又塌不下来。”耸耸肩，等自己的冒险者凭证"}
{"time": 1770564975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024292193", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "总之你等了一下就领到了两铜牌子"}
{"time": 1770565014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308293171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "总之你等了一下就领到了两铁牌子，上面还着拓你的姓名之类的除开住址的基本信息"}
{"time": 1770565195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644628683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收起牌子，打听一下会长的事，“我听说会长之前单人斩杀过魔龙？嗯？能说说看吗？”"}
{"time": 1770565508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133527506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“会长？哦，那个啊”"}
{"time": 1770565680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952164648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“地魔龙在两年前在熔石火山出现，会长接到任务之后带着自己组建的【焚天】小队去讨伐，之后就顺利的回来了，不过听说在一年前在会长成为会长的时候焚天小队就解散了，真是可惜”"}
{"time": 1770565754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436930489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯?那焚天有哪些成员?\""}
{"time": 1770565907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060228466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（焚天神兵）"}
{"time": 1770566212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945067700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“【血剑】瓦罗刹，【魔鲸】克劳迪娅，【花叶】露妮可，【天慧】莱尔德，【窃骰】柯莱”"}
{"time": 1770566352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834052449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（额😑这个窃骰是什么人）"}
{"time": 1770566355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273493635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（我倒要看看）"}
{"time": 1770566547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271107811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"称号都有些吓人呢——他们是什么样的人?\""}
{"time": 1770566690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983488158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“他们都没有来过首都，不过根据公开的资料记载，里面只有血剑还有天慧是男性，两人都很帅气呢”"}
{"time": 1770566785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699746091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好的，那看来也不太可能会遇见了。总之谢谢啦。\"打个招呼，把自己和安娜的牌子一并递给安娜，看一眼挂着的委托"}
{"time": 1770566948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391310371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "委托版任务挂的秘密麻麻，像是找猫，找人，送东西，采药这些都是铁级别能接的，还有些专门狩猎魔物的任务，不过这些级别的任务都堆积到至少铜级别的了"}
{"time": 1770566985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45191611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "看起来都是抬手就狩猎有着近百数量魔物的集群，或者是某处的魔物之王"}
{"time": 1770567077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56474795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"之后和另外几人讨论一下好了，\"安娜～走吧，我们回去了。\""}
{"time": 1770567111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147510573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "———————————"}
